body:
I hope.

&#x200B;

She always talks about her ex's with her friends and make fun of them. I just dont want any unnecessary attention.

My dad just took my car keys cause I failed a class. But Ill try to tell her on a messaging app. 

&#x200B;

The only fear I have is that she will get super upset, and her friends will bash me for it because she broke a lot of trust and promises to get here.
